{"about_the_game":"Serke is a hack and slash game where you fight against a virus invasion.<br>Use 5 different weapons to defeat your enemies and save the virtual world.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/\uc560\ub2c8\uba54\uc774\uc158.gif?t=1742569349\" /><br><br><br>Cyanea<br> Cyanea is a one-handed sword weapon with excellent mobility.<br> It is a well-balanced weapon with all abilities satisfactory.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/\uc18c\ub4dc.gif?t=1742569349\" /><br><br><br>Spinifer<br> Spinifer summons drones and turrets based on his rifle to constantly move and fight.<br> It is a weapon that can attack the enemy unilaterally from a distance.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/\ub77c\uc774\ud50c.gif?t=1742569349\" /><br><br><br>Red clawed<br> Red clawed is a large halberd-shaped melee weapon.<br> Crush your enemies in one blow with powerful damage.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/\ud560\ubc84\ub4dc.gif?t=1742569349\" /><br><br><br>Imperator<br> Imperator is a powerful ranged weapon that uses firepower equipment.<br> Destroy enemies using high-power equipment such as shotguns, gatling, laser cannons, and grenades.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/\ud5e4\ube44\uc6e8\ud380.gif?t=1742569349\" /><br><br><br>Death stolker<br> Death stolker is a close-quarters fighting weapon.<br> Because you attack with kicks and punches, you can have a fast-paced battle.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825410/extras/\uac74\ud2c0\ub81b.gif?t=1742569349\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Stage Clear!","path